+8.9.3 General business rules for Pay at Hotel
+No.
+Requirement
+Business Rule
+1
+No-Show Fee Configuration
+Hotel merchants can configure No-Show Fee up to 30% of the room booking price.
+2
+Upfront Fee Collection
+Collect Commission, No-Show Fee, and Transaction Fee through online payment.
+3
+Fee Snapshot
+Save the applicable fee rates and amounts at booking confirmation.
+4
+Free Cancellation
+Refund Commission + No-Show Fee; Transaction Fee is non-refundable.
+5
+Late Cancellation
+No refund; settle No-Show Fee to hotel merchant.
+6
+Customer No-Show
+No refund; settle No-Show Fee to hotel merchant.
+7
+Hotel / mTrip Cancellation
+Refund the full Pay Now Fee (Online).
+8
+Merchant Settlement
+Settle only the configured No-Show Fee to the hotel merchant.
+9
+Finance Reconciliation
+Track Commission, No-Show Fee, Transaction Fee, customer refunds, and merchant settlements separately.
+8.10. Business Rules
 Customers make a single payment to mTrip for the hotel booking.
 mTrip deducts the agreed commission before settling the remaining amount to the hotel merchant.
 Merchant settlement is processed according to the configured settlement cycle (e.g., weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly).
